The ClearX App is an integral component of the ClearX Aligners treatment, and it can only be used with ClearX products.
With the ClearX App users can find all the information on their orthodontic treatment plan, and also use it to connect with the ClearX booster to activate the shape-shifting effect in their ClearX aligners. 
The ClearX App has many features to guide users throughout the orthodontic treatment, monitoring and customizing it according to their needs.
ClearX App users will be instructed on how to boost their aligners as per the manufacturer's instructions.
It is mandatory to have the Bluetooth function turned on to successfully connect the ClearX App with the ClearX booster.
Users can access their ClearX treatment plan anytime they want, and boost their aligners once a week, following the ClearX App guidance.

Features in the ClearX App:
- Connection with the ClearX Booster;
- Notifications of important events in your ClearX Aligners treatment;
- Scheduling the ClearX Aligners wearing, boosting and changing days;
- Monitoring the pressure, fit and comfort of the ClearX Aligners;
- Adapting the boosting frequency according to your treatment results;

My Pregnancy is a week-by-week pregnancy tracker. Our app will help you over the course of your pregnancy. Stay on top of the changes happening inside your body. Find out how your baby is developing.

Our app is completely free and does not contain advertising.

This app includes:
- week-by-week advice;
- useful information on fetal development and changes in your body;
- week-by-week fetal measurements and imaging;
- a to-do list for each trimester;
- a list of things you will need for hospital check-in, post-natal care and check-out;
- a weight tracker you can use to follow weight gain;
- a kick counter;
- a contraction timer;
- and much more

We have created this app with love, specially for young mothers.

This app is not intended for medical use and is not a substitute for medical consultation.

